<title>SWEDEN: Spectra-Physics sells Dansk Mobil stake.</title>
<headline>Spectra-Physics sells Dansk Mobil stake.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish electro-optical group Spectra-Physics said on Thursday it had sold its 25 percent interest in the Danish Dansk Mobiltelefon AB to NordicTel Holdings AB for 49 million crowns.</p>
<p>&quot;The transaction will mean a small capital gain and an improved financial net in the future,&quot; Spectra-Physics said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom, +46-8-700 1006</p>
</text>
